tail equity orders route to our clearing firm, which routes them onward, an=
d we receive no rebate, credit or reduction in clearing costs tied to routi=
ng. On listed options we do receive an exchange rebate, credited monthly, a=
t the rates in the schedule produced as item 2A. In 2013 that credit totale=
d $91,400.<br />
<br />
